s on C1 additions, and maybe use grep to locate relevant functions.\n\nStart with prelude.cljc first — find new functions via grep.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me look at the actual code. I'll start by sizing up the files and locating the new C1 pre"}]}}
