r packet ✓. Either way loud ✓.\n\nNext, scope_test.clj — let me quickly check the comprehensions tests. Also the e2e_test.clj fixes (escape-restores-handlers-test etc., preexisting). Check scope_test for the placement of the first-iterable lambda and the class-body comprehensions.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Reader conditionals all have `:cljd` first; no gensym/rand/volatile-in-guest issues. Let me check"}]}}
