etc., preexisting). Check scope_test for the placement of the first-iterable lambda and the class-body comprehensions.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Reader conditionals all have `:cljd` first; no gensym/rand/volatile-in-guest issues. Let me check the scope test additions.\n\n"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_e695623cc06b41d19771c28e","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"deftest|testing \"","path":"/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-py-c1/test/yang/python/antlr/scope_test.clj","output_mode":"content","-n":true}}],"meta":{"source":"model","createdAt":1790853878506,"messageId":"633cf18d-8ba7-43c7-8ce6-30e404b66885"}},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call_e695623cc06b41d19771c28e","content":[{"type":"text","text":"test/yang/python/antlr/scope_test.clj:5:    [clojure.test :refer [deftest is testing]]\ntest/yang/python/antlr/scope_test.clj:34:(deftest locals-and-params-test\ntest/yang/python/antlr/scope_test.clj:54:    (testing \"params first, then other bindings in first-occurrence order;\ntest/yang/python/antlr/scope_test.clj:63:(deftest module-names-are-globals-test\ntest/yang/python/antlr/scope_test.clj:73:(deftest global-declaration-test\ntest/yang/python/antlr/scope_test.clj:84:(deftest nonlocal-declaration-test\ntest/yang/python/antlr/scope_test.clj:96:(deftest forward-capture-test\ntest/yang/python/antlr/scope_test.clj:97:  (testing \"a free name resolves to the enclosing function's local even\ntest/yang/python/antlr/scope_test.clj:108:(deftest class-scope-test\ntest/yang/python/antlr/scope_test.clj:122:    (testing \"methods skip the class scope\"\ntest/yang/python/antlr/scope_test.clj:127:(deftest lambda-scope-test\ntest/yang/python/antlr/scope_test.clj:136:(deftest tuple-star-and-with-targets-test\ntest/yang/python/antlr/scope_test.clj:153:(deftest comprehension-scope-test\ntest/yang/python/antlr/scope_test.clj:154:  (testing \"comprehension targets are local to the comprehension, not the\ntest/yang/python/antlr/scope_test.clj:1